course: dictionary
lesson: 14021
title: Context and the mailman
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A mailman is a person whose job is to bring letters and parcels to homes and offices. Other words for the same job are mail carrier, letter carrier, postman, postwoman and postal worker. If you read «The postwoman left a parcel on our step», you can work out that she does the same job as a mailman.
explain: Look at the words around a word to find its meaning. «The mailman puts the letters into each mailbox before lunch.» The job is to bring letters, and the mailbox is where the letters go. In a maths sum, words like «each house» tell you to multiply, and «shared among» tells you to divide, but the mailman is still just the person doing the job.
explain: Test your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. «The mailman walked his route and waved at the dog.» Put in «a person who brings letters» and it still makes sense. Put in «a box for letters» and it does not, so you know the word means the person.
fact: A mailman is a person whose job is to bring letters and parcels to homes and offices.
fact: Mailman is one person; mailmen is the plural, for more than one person.
fact: Other words for the same job are mail carrier, letter carrier, postman, postwoman and postal worker.
fact: A mailman usually follows a route and puts mail into mailboxes or letter boxes.
fact: In stories, the mailman is often a friendly helper in the neighbourhood.
exercise: «The mailman brought a parcel for Mum today.» What is a mailman? | *A person whose job is to bring letters and parcels | A dog that barks at the door | A kind of parcel | A box at the end of the garden for letters
exercise: Each house on Elm Street gets 3 letters, and there are 9 houses. How many letters does the mailman deliver? | 12 | *27 | 6 | 39
exercise: Which word means the same job as mailman? | *Letter carrier | Milkshake | Gardener | Lamplighter
test: «The mailman puts the letters in the mailbox before lunch.» Where do the letters go? | *In the mailbox | Into the oven | In the sea | Under the bed
test: What is the plural of mailman, when there is more than one? | mailmanes | mailman's | *mailmen | mailmans
exam: «The mailman walked his route and waved hello, but the dog barked at him.» Which word tells you the mailman follows the same path each day? | barked | mailbox | *route | parcel
